            "title_h3": false,
            "text": "<p>Nearsighted vision means you can see nearby objects clearly, but distant objects appear blurry.</p><p><strong>Technical Insight:</strong> This occurs when the eye focuses light in front of the retina.</p><p><strong>Example Prescription:</strong> A typical prescription might be -2.5 or -2.50. Always displayed as a negative number)</p>",
