            "title_h3": false,
            "text": "<p>Farsighted vision means you can see distant objects clearly, but close-up objects appear blurry.</p><p><strong>Technical Insight:</strong> This happens when the eye focuses light behind the retina.</p><p><strong>Example Prescription:</strong> A common prescription might be +2.0 or +2.00. Always displayed as a positive number.</p>",
